# menu-alive.pad — nudge the main menu often enough that it does not time out into the attract loop.
#
# Left idle, the main menu hands over to the attract movie after about 20 seconds, and the engine's
# frame counter stops advancing while the movie plays — a capture clocked off that counter simply ends
# there ("emulator stopped ticking"). Down-then-up keeps the highlighted entry where it started, so the
# game is awake and the menu is unchanged. Timing is wall-clock, not frame-exact; that is fine here,
# because nothing in the capture is being asked to line up with these presses.
press down 100
sleep 4000
press up 100
sleep 4000
press down 100
sleep 4000
press up 100
sleep 4000
press down 100
sleep 4000
press up 100
sleep 4000
press down 100
sleep 4000
press up 100
sleep 4000
press down 100
sleep 4000
press up 100
